THIS IS A 50% CHANCE FILLER FOR THE GROUP BREAK LISTED IN THE TITLE. 50% of the participants will receive a spot in this break and 50% will NOT receive a spot in this break.
This is an Evolved Team Filler for PYT GB1018. Meaning all remaining teams not purchased will be added to a team pool and cost averaged. The amount of spots will then be doubled to equal that of a 50% Chance Filler. The list will be randomized using Random.org and the top half (#) of participants will receive teams in this break in the order of the available teams.
